sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Vitesse page
    participant VC as Vitesse Controller
    participant VT as SQL table: vitesse

    Admin->>UI: Open speed/vitesse page
    Admin->>UI: Select date range

    par Load daily speed series
        UI->>VC: Request daily speed statistics
        VC->>VT: Group speed by recorded date
        VT-->>VC: Daily average and maximum speed
        VC-->>UI: Daily speed series
    and Load period summary
        UI->>VC: Request speed summary
        VC->>VT: Calculate period average and maximum
        VT-->>VC: Summary values
        VC-->>UI: Summary values
    end

    UI-->>Admin: Display speed chart and summary cards
    alt Invalid range, no data or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show empty state or error message
    end
